ask, washing hands, sitting in the sun","Washing hands, sitting in the sun, sleeping more","Vaccination, washing hands, not sitting in the sun"],"correctIndex":0,"page":34,"difficulty":2,"source":"elearn","reviewNote":"mask, hand washing and vaccination prevent contagious disease; official answer included 'sitting in the sun'","explanation":"Mask, hand washing and vaccination prevent contagious disease."},{"id":"el-b52-elq-dc72a185235cde64","chapterId":"el-b52-c3","topicId":"el-b52-t3321-1","type":"mcq","text":"What steps will you take to ensure others do not get the flu from you?","options":["Wash hands","Sleep for more time","Sit in the sun","Wear mask"],"correctIndex":3,"page":37,"difficulty":2,"source":"elearn"},{"id":"el-b52-elq-42e983db9c54e951","chapterId":"el-b52-c3","topicId":"el-b52-t3322-1","type":"mcq","text":"What is the cause of polio?","options":["Bacteria","Virus","House fly","Mosquito"],"correctIndex":1,"page":37,"difficulty":2,"source":"elearn"},{"id":"el-b52-elq-88d0dd5c2e57a208","chapterId":"el-b52-c3","topicId":"el-b52-t2719-0","type":"mcq","text":"Which food has the highest calcium content?","options":["Meat","Rice","Milk","Pulse"],"correctIndex":2,"page":38,"difficulty":2,"source":"elearn"},{"id":"el-b52-elq-cfa71514a006ba26","chapterId":"el-b52-c4","topicId":"el-b52-t2721-0","type":"mcq","text":"Which one of these groups is the correct example of the three states of matter?","options":["Snow, Rain, Cloud","Dew, Rain, Water Vapours","Snow, Cloud, Steam","Rain, Water Vapours, Cloud"],"correctIndex":0,"page":46,"difficulty":2,"source":"elearn"},{"id":"el-b52-elq-b1ca4773bceac153","chapterId":"el-b52-c4","topicId":"el-b52-t3332-1","type":"mcq","text":"Which one of the following has the most volume?","options":["Book","Pencil","Scale","Cricket bat"],"correctIndex":3,"page":48,"difficulty":2,"source":"elearn"},{"id":"el-b52-elq-3205f326d242bf85","chapterId":"el-b52-c4","topicId":"el-b52-t3335-1","type":"mcq","text":"Water ice and steam all have dif